id: 1
hanzi: 四合院
pinyin: sì hé yuàn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: siheyuan; traditional Chinese quadrangle courtyard dwelling
  es: siheyuan; patio cuadrangular tradicional de Pekín

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | a traditional Chinese residential compound consisting of houses arranged around a central square courtyard on four sides | vivienda residencial tradicional china compuesta por pabellones en cuatro lados en torno a un patio central | 北京老城区的四合院 (traditional quadrangle courtyards of old Beijing)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 爷爷在北京胡同里那座青砖灰瓦的四合院里生活了大半辈子，院子里常年种着石榴树与枣树。 | Yéye zài Běijīng hútòng lǐ nà zuò qīngzhuān-huīwǎ de sìhéyuàn lǐ shēnghuó le dàbànbèizi, yuànzi lǐ chángnián zhòng zhe shíliushù yǔ zǎoshù. | Grandfather lived for over half his life in that grey-brick and tiled courtyard house in a Beijing alley, where pomegranate and jujube trees grew year-round. | El abuelo vivió más de media vida en aquel patio cuadrangular de ladrillo gris en un hutong pekinés, donde crecían granados y azufaifos.
  #2 | 作为中国传统建筑文化的杰出代表，保存完好的四合院如今已成为中外游客体验老北京民俗风情的必访之地。 | Zuòwéi Zhōngguó chuántǒng jiànzhù wénhuà de jiéchū dàibiǎo, bǎocún wánhǎo de sìhéyuàn rújīn yǐ chéngwéi zhōngwài yóukè tǐyàn lǎo Běijīng mínsú fēngqíng de bìfǎng zhīdì. | As an outstanding representative of traditional Chinese architectural culture, well-preserved courtyard homes are now must-visit sites for cultural immersion. | Como joya de la arquitectura tradicional china, los patios bien conservados son paradas obligadas para que viajeros de todo el mundo descubran el viejo Pekín.

